---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, contact, mailto } from '../config/site';

const security = contact('security');
---
<Base title="Security" description="How to report a security vulnerability to the Open Autonomous Systems Alliance, what is in scope, what happens next and our planned security practices.">
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Security</h1>
      <p class="lede">OASA is built around encrypted links and secure defaults. If you find a weakness, we want to hear about it.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap section prose">
    <p class="note note-draft"><strong>Draft policy.</strong> Last updated {site.policies.draftDate}. It will be reviewed as OASA grows.</p>

    <h2 class="first">Report a vulnerability</h2>
    <p>Email <a href={mailto(security, 'Security report')}>{security}</a>. Please include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>What you found and where.</li>
      <li>Steps to reproduce it.</li>
      <li>What you think the impact is.</li>
      <li>How to reach you, if you want a reply.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>In scope</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>joinoasa.org</li>
      <li>OASA's GitHub repositories, published designs and firmware, once they exist</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Out of scope</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Third-party platforms we use. Report those to the platform.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Ground rules</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Don't access other people's data.</li>
      <li>Don't degrade the service.</li>
      <li>Give us time to fix the issue before you publish it.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Good-faith research is welcome.</p>

    <h2>What happens next</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Acknowledgement.</strong> {site.security.responseTime ? `We aim to acknowledge your report ${site.security.responseTime}.` : 'We will confirm we received your report.'}</li>
      <li><strong>Triage.</strong> The Security council reviews it. During the founding phase, the founder does.</li>
      <li><strong>Fix.</strong> We fix the issue and test the fix.</li>
      <li><strong>Credit.</strong> If you want credit, we'll name you.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>We don't offer paid bounties yet.</p>

    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <p>These are the rules we are setting up for ourselves:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Two-factor authentication for every member.</li>
      <li>Hardware security keys for Leads, Core members and contract staff.</li>
      <li>Code review and signed releases for official projects.</li>
      <li>Dependency and secret scanning.</li>
      <li>Firmware signing, so devices only run trusted code.</li>
    </ul>

    <p><a class="text-link" href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>
  .prose .first { margin-top: 0; }
</style>
